    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A Large or smaller creature hit by a net is restrained until freed. Has no effect on formless creatures or creatures that are Huge or larger.</p><p>A creature can use its action to make a DC 10 Strength check, freeing itself or another creature within reach on a success. Dealing 5 damage to the net (AC 10) also frees the creature.</p><p><strong>Special.</strong> Attacks with this weapon don't have disadvantage within close range.</p>",
